# Post-confirmation message (example)
#
# Sent (once, through the Approve-and-send gate) after a booking is confirmed, in place
# of the old short scheduling-links message. The two Cal.com booking links are folded in
# via the {dropoff_link} and {pickup_link} placeholders — those are the ONLY placeholders
# substituted; everything else is sent verbatim. Copy this to post_confirmation.md and
# fill in your real address/wording (that copy is gitignored).
#
# NOTE: the leading comment lines above (starting with '#') are stripped before sending.

Thanks for confirming!

Couple of things I would need from you:

Could you text me here your pup’s feeding schedule (how much & when) and medication schedule (if applicable) for my reference?

To schedule drop off & pickup, please use the following links:

Drop-off

{dropoff_link}

Pick-up

{pickup_link}

If you need to reschedule, you can do so using the confirmation email you got from cal.com. Let me know if none of the times work, we can figure something out!

Packing list:

Please ensure to bring the following:

- Food

- water AND food bowls

- leash

- Portioning container (cup, scoop, etc) that you use specifically to measure your pup’s food, OR pre-portioned food in zip-loc bags

Everything else will be optional. Feel free to bring treats/toys/blankets if you like, or these will be otherwise provided by me.

My address:

123 Example St.

Note for drop off and pickup -

Please avoid knocking on my door as my dog will go crazy lol. Text me your eta when you're on the way and I will meet you in my driveway. If you got here and I am not in my driveway, please shoot me a text and I will come out!
